[18.601808, "o", "## Demo report\r\n\r\n"]
[18.601873, "o", "* The mocked LLM connection succeeded and all 13 available tools ran. Use Page Up and Page Down to revisit the colored\r\n  output.\r\n\r\n"]
[18.602123, "o", "+-----------------+-------------------+------------------+\r\n"]
[18.602202, "o", "| Feature         |   Demonstration   |           Safety |\r\n+-----------------+-------------------+------------------+\r\n| LLM connection  | Mocked with delay |          Offline |\r\n| Tool calls      |  All 13 schemas   |           Mocked |\r\n| Cancellation    |    Every phase    |           Ctrl+C |\r\n"]
[18.602269, "o", "| Code diffs      |  Write and edit   | No files changed |\r\n| Markdown tables |  Aligned output   |    Width bounded |\r\n| Model search    |  241 fake models  |      No API call |\r\n"]
[18.602323, "o", "| History paging  |  Colored content  |      PgUp / PgDn |\r\n| Completion time |   Whole seconds   |    Deterministic |\r\n+-----------------+-------------------+------------------+\r\n"]
[18.602586, "o", "\u001b[s\u001b[36;1H\u001b[2K[CONTEXT ~69% left] [PROVIDER demo] [MODEL scripted-demo] [WORKSPACE ~/.openclaw/projects/qcode]\u001b[u\u001b[s\u001b[1;1H\u001b[2K*[main +] [agent-1 >]                                                              Switch tabs: Ctrl+PgUp/PgDn | Alt+,/.\u001b[u"]
[18.602615, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2mCompleted in 18s\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m> \u001b[0m"]
